About

    This subdirectory contains patches intended to load some features from tje AGAMA library via its Fortran interface into Ramses.
    The files:
        agama.a
        agama.so
        test_fortran.f
    have been linked or copied from:
        /Users/tepper/Library/Python/3.9/lib/python/site-packages/agama
    and correspond to the static library, the dynamic library, and a Fortran example code.
    IMPORTANT: The AGAMA library must be compiled on the SAME system that these patches are meant to be run!

